      "statusChangeID": "63fbbc1cd8bc94451e5a6bd8",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "A flowchart for Udon's execution order was added to our documentation last month. We hope it will make it easier for world creators to create and debug their Udon scripts!\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/event-execution-order\n\nNote that the flowchart is abbreviated for visual clarity. Please let us know if there's any information you'd like us to add.\n\nUdon's and Unity's execution order may change in future updates!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-09T19:45:15.764Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In Udon it can be tough to know what events happen in which order. Can `OnDeserialization` fire before `Start`? How to find out?\n# Suggestion\n**Add a flowchart to the documentation which shows the order in which Udon events can happen.**\n\nUnity already has a similar flowchart on their website: https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/ExecutionOrder.html\n\nOf course Unity's chart doesn't include Udon events, and includes many, many events which are not accessible in Udon.\n\nIf someone's already made a flowchart, feel free to post it here please! 👍",
